sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant Grading
    participant Submission
    participant DB as grading_db
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant Notification

    Client->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/grades + JWT
    Gateway->>Gateway: Validate JWT cục bộ
    Gateway->>Grading: HTTP + trace/principal context
    Grading->>Submission: Validate/read submission
    Submission-->>Grading: Submission snapshot
    Grading->>DB: Persist grade
    DB-->>Grading: Grade persisted
    Grading->>MQ: Publish grade.completed + trace context
    Grading-->>Gateway: Grade representation
    Gateway-->>Client: 201 Created
    MQ-->>Notification: Deliver grade.completed
    Notification->>Notification: Simulated notification processing
    Note over Grading,Notification: Async edge được correlation qua event/trace context
